---
description: Conventions for creating/editing wiki pages
globs: wiki/**/*.md
---

You are editing a wiki entity page. Follow the **Wiki page conventions** section in
`AGENTS.md` (repo root): filename `Title-Case-Kebab.md`, the page structure (one-sentence
definition first; optional `## Practical application`; `## Opinions`; mandatory `## Sources`;
mandatory `## Notes`), the opinion attribution format, and lazy hub creation.

Hard rules that apply here: never edit content under `## Notes` (user-owned), never invent
sources or facts, never silently overwrite — append contradictions to `## Opinions` with a
`[CONTRADICTION: <brief>]` flag.
